  // sample never has to reach the texture edge — CLAMP_TO_EDGE stretches
  // whatever pixel it lands on when it does, which read as a thin grey
  // border on light-edged photos. The max possible push (flow clamped to
  // [-1,1], scaled by uFlowStrength ~0.035, split adds another ~15%) is well
  // inside this 6% band, so the effect itself is untouched everywhere but
  // right at the crop line.
